{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time for revenge! Lead the army of dogs to victory in this strategic Tower Defense where managing your towers will be essential. Rebuild the Village to unlock and upgrade ever more powerful turrets! Are you up to the challenge that awaits you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Analyze the map and place your defense towers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/70217a6c91c8d7ea9851ebaba6c97366.poster.avif?t=1773399410\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/70217a6c91c8d7ea9851ebaba6c97366.webm?t=1773399410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/70217a6c91c8d7ea9851ebaba6c97366.mp4?t=1773399410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face waves of enemy cats and defend yourself by building increasingly crazy defense towers, all operated by strong-willed dogs! Be strategic in your placement, or you\u2019ll quickly be overwhelmed by the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your money wisely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/4e7a96577724b9e136a5bc531a765d62.poster.avif?t=1773399410\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/4e7a96577724b9e136a5bc531a765d62.webm?t=1773399410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/4e7a96577724b9e136a5bc531a765d62.mp4?t=1773399410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating your enemies will earn you money to build more towers or upgrade existing ones, but it may be wiser to save for the long term... The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade the village and your towers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/2d43c416059e4b4c15bad4e7d12a9dc3.poster.avif?t=1773399410\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/2d43c416059e4b4c15bad4e7d12a9dc3.webm?t=1773399410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/2d43c416059e4b4c15bad4e7d12a9dc3.mp4?t=1773399410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn as much money as possible to rebuild your village, unlock new towers with surprising powers, and upgrade them to fend off the mighty tanks of the cat army!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/0fa64df5549af9abde12a99b57078530.poster.avif?t=1773399410\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/0fa64df5549af9abde12a99b57078530.webm?t=1773399410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/0fa64df5549af9abde12a99b57078530.mp4?t=1773399410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different environments for varied fun </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 levels to put you to the test! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful graphics and charming characters! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully translated into 9 languages </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can pet the dogs! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-save to avoid losing progress!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4013110?t=1773399410","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/284978dae8c23fcfc603b957a9a076adb259ddb0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773399410","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/24e2273e572e00c754ecc6fbce21a8761260fffb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773399410","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/24e2273e572e00c754ecc6fbce21a8761260fffb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773399410","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time for revenge! Lead the army of dogs to victory in this strategic Tower Defense where managing your towers will be essential. Rebuild the Village to unlock and upgrade ever more powerful turrets! Are you up to the challenge that awaits you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Analyze the map and place your defense towers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset